        "paragraphs": [
          {
            "paragraphId": "para-mock-gd-2026-m1-cloze-title",
            "nodes": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I majored in Mechanical Engineering in college and what I experienced during the job-hunting season in my final year changed my life completely. At that time, I only had one ",
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[0].text",
                  "start": 0,
                  "end": 174
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "blank",
                "questionId": "q-mock-gd-2026-m1-041",
                "blankId": "blank-mock-gd-2026-m1-041",
                "hint": null,
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[0].text",
                  "start": 174,
                  "end": 180
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ": to join an automaker giant in my country. I ",
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[0].text",
                  "start": 180,
                  "end": 226
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "blank",
                "questionId": "q-mock-gd-2026-m1-042",
                "blankId": "blank-mock-gd-2026-m1-042",
                "hint": null,
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[0].text",
                  "start": 226,
                  "end": 232
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " other opportunities and poured all my energy into this company. I cleared the written test and felt ",
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[0].text",
                  "start": 232,
                  "end": 333
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "blank",
                "questionId": "q-mock-gd-2026-m1-043",
                "blankId": "blank-mock-gd-2026-m1-043",
                "hint": null,
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[0].text",
                  "start": 333,
                  "end": 339
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " about my interview, performance, but the results hit. me hard—I was ",
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[0].text",
                  "start": 339,
                  "end": 408
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "blank",
                "questionId": "q-mock-gd-2026-m1-044",
                "blankId": "blank-mock-gd-2026-m1-044",
                "hint": null,
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[0].text",
                  "start": 408,
                  "end": 414
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ".",
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[0].text",
                  "start": 414,
                  "end": 415
                }
              }
            ],
            "sourceSpan": {
              "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[0].text",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 415
            }
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "para-mock-gd-2026-m1-cloze-p1",
            "nodes": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "For days, I couldn’t pull myself together, and I ",
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[1].text",
                  "start": 0,
                  "end": 49
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "blank",
                "questionId": "q-mock-gd-2026-m1-045",
                "blankId": "blank-mock-gd-2026-m1-045",
                "hint": null,
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[1].text",
                  "start": 49,
                  "end": 55
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " the interviewers, my luck, everyone else but myself. Everything ",
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[1].text",
                  "start": 55,
                  "end": 120
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "blank",
                "questionId": "q-mock-gd-2026-m1-046",
                "blankId": "blank-mock-gd-2026-m1-046",
                "hint": null,
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[1].text",
                  "start": 120,
                  "end": 126
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " when I attended a seminar on the locus of control (控制源) —the idea that you are ",
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[1].text",
                  "start": 126,
                  "end": 206
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "blank",
                "questionId": "q-mock-gd-2026-m1-047",
                "blankId": "blank-mock-gd-2026-m1-047",
                "hint": null,
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[1].text",
                  "start": 206,
                  "end": 212
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " for whatever happens to you, whether good or bad. This ",
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[1].text",
                  "start": 212,
                  "end": 268
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "blank",
                "questionId": "q-mock-gd-2026-m1-048",
                "blankId": "blank-mock-gd-2026-m1-048",
                "hint": null,
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[1].text",
                  "start": 268,
                  "end": 274
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " me deeply and pushed me to look inward.",
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[1].text",
                  "start": 274,
                  "end": 314
                }
              }
            ],
            "sourceSpan": {
              "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[1].text",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 314
            }
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "para-mock-gd-2026-m1-cloze-p2",
            "nodes": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I realized I had always shifted responsibility outward—My parents’ fault, my school’s issue—never mine. When I reviewed my interview honestly, I saw the ",
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[2].text",
                  "start": 0,
                  "end": 153
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "blank",
                "questionId": "q-mock-gd-2026-m1-049",
                "blankId": "blank-mock-gd-2026-m1-049",
                "hint": null,
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[2].text",
                  "start": 153,
                  "end": 159
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ": I had knowledge gaps and communication weaknesses. So I ",
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[2].text",
                  "start": 159,
                  "end": 217
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "blank",
                "questionId": "q-mock-gd-2026-m1-050",
                "blankId": "blank-mock-gd-2026-m1-050",
                "hint": null,
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[2].text",
                  "start": 217,
                  "end": 223
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " them. In the next interview, with better ",
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[2].text",
                  "start": 223,
                  "end": 265
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "blank",
                "questionId": "q-mock-gd-2026-m1-051",
                "blankId": "blank-mock-gd-2026-m1-051",
                "hint": null,
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[2].text",
                  "start": 265,
                  "end": 271
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " and real self-awareness, I performed far better and ",
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[2].text",
                  "start": 271,
                  "end": 324
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "blank",
                "questionId": "q-mock-gd-2026-m1-052",
                "blankId": "blank-mock-gd-2026-m1-052",
                "hint": null,
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[2].text",
                  "start": 324,
                  "end": 330
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " a position in a company even better than the one I had originally dreamed of.",
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[2].text",
                  "start": 330,
                  "end": 408
                }
              }
            ],
            "sourceSpan": {
              "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[2].text",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 408
            }
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "para-mock-gd-2026-m1-cloze-p3",
            "nodes": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "They say failure is a harsh (苛刻的) but far more ",
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[3].text",
                  "start": 0,
                  "end": 47
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "blank",
                "questionId": "q-mock-gd-2026-m1-053",
                "blankId": "blank-mock-gd-2026-m1-053",
                "hint": null,
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[3].text",
                  "start": 47,
                  "end": 53
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " teacher than success. That season, I graduated not just as an engineer, but as a student of life, learning that when you ",
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[3].text",
                  "start": 53,
                  "end": 175
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "blank",
                "questionId": "q-mock-gd-2026-m1-054",
                "blankId": "blank-mock-gd-2026-m1-054",
                "hint": null,
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[3].text",
                  "start": 175,
                  "end": 181
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " blaming, the world and start owning your failures, you ",
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[3].text",
                  "start": 181,
                  "end": 237
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "blank",
                "questionId": "q-mock-gd-2026-m1-055",
                "blankId": "blank-mock-gd-2026-m1-055",
                "hint": null,
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[3].text",
                  "start": 237,
                  "end": 243
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " the power to build a better version of yourself.",
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[3].text",
