              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " the city as his second home. With cameras and curiosity, he captures (拍摄) the country’s landscapes and people, ",
                "sourceSpan": {
                  "sourcePath": "group.passage.paragraphs[0].text",
                  "start": 114,
                  "end": 226
